# ------------------------------------------------------------- Experiments
# The reported results (logs, figures, summary CSVs, small models) ARE committed:
# the README cites them and they let anyone check the numbers without re-running.
# Only scratch output and console logs are ignored.
results/demo/                 # optional demo run from notebook 01
results/smoke*/               # quick smoke tests
results/*.log                 # console output of run_all (tuning_run.log, main_run.log, ...)
nohup.out

# If the repository gets too large, uncomment to stop tracking trained models
# (they can be regenerated with `python -m scripts.run_all`):
# results/**/models/